{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options:\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n2. **Pipewell**: Strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n3. **Tallyfox**: Multiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\nA quick way to decide: pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Pipewell if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50de-702b-9cf6-c566b6b3af83","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:27.500Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales tools slack gmail"],"latency_ms":10020,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[139,152],[515,528]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[261,269],[545,553]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[351,359]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factu